# The depth must be the reference's (RECEPTION-EDGE-DEBTS (e)): a caller's `@@: void` under the name its reader uses
# as a Model reference is refused at the call that forms the input.
Model: (size_t: value 11U)
@: Model shared @Model
fn: observe () size_t
return: shared\value
fn: relay () size_t
return: observe()
fn: caller (@: void p) size_t
    @@: void shared @p
return: relay()
size_t: r caller(@Model)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
